  <p id="c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001:m0000" ref="dkd_jrm_hin">鑒</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001:m0002" ref="yyk_ziw_so2">濤</persName>及弟子<persName id="c-jinshu-071-wangtao-wangyin:p001:m0006" ref="7o0_9qh_xv1">戭</persName>，並有才筆。濤字茂略，曆著作郎、無錫令。戭字庭堅，亦為著作。並早卒。</p>
